-- Name: COLUMN biodata_invitation_form_rcs.fingerprick; Type: COMMENT; Schema: redcap; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN redcap.biodata_invitation_form_rcs.fingerprick IS 'Would you be willing to provide a blood sample at home using the finger prick method? 
A finger prick is a method of drawing blood using a
small device called a lancet. Lancets prick the finger
to produce a drop of blood, which is placed on
special paper.  
  
No genetic testing will be conducted without your consent.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN biodata_invitation_form_rcs.results_return; Type: COMMENT; Schema: redcap; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN redcap.biodata_invitation_form_rcs.results_return IS 'Would you like to receive a copy of your personalized health results?';


--
-- Name: COLUMN biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_participation; Type: COMMENT; Schema: redcap; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN redcap.biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_participation IS 'Would you be willing to provide an additional sample (e.g. blood spot and/or saliva) to be stored
to be used for later analyses?

No genetic testing will be conducted without your consent.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_addblood; Type: COMMENT; Schema: redcap; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN redcap.biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_addblood IS 'Please send an additional blood spot kit.  
  
No genetic testing will be conducted without your consent.

Please note that these samples will be archived and you will not receive personalized health information by completing this kit.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_saliva; Type: COMMENT; Schema: redcap; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN redcap.biodata_invitation_form_rcs.archive_saliva IS 'Please send a saliva kit.  
  
This would involve collecting saliva in a tube at home and mailing it. No genetic testing will be conducted without your consent.

Please note that these samples will be archived and you will not receive personalized health information by completing this kit.';


